{"id": 86, "ts": 1780424137.2027318, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 5, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I remain convinced that Candidate\u202fC is the strongest overall fit. His 100\u202f% reliability and ability to make correct decisions quickly address the core safety\u2011critical criteria of operational reliability and decision quality. Moreover, he creates a positive atmosphere with his crew, which speaks to crew cooperation. My only reservation is his difficulty communicating ideas and his egocentric attitude, which could undermine teamwork on long\u2011haul flights. I\u2019d like to hear from James whether there are concrete examples of how C\u2019s communication style has impacted crew interactions in past operations. Barring serious evidence that this issue compromises safety, I would continue to recommend Candidate\u202fC."}
